### Criar produto
POST {{base_url}}/api/products
Authorization: Bearer {{tenant_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nome": "Consultoria Trabalhista",
  "descricao": "Consultoria em direito trabalhista",
  "palavras_chave": ["trabalhista", "CLT", "rescisão", "FGTS"]
}

> {%
    client.global.set("product_id", response.body.id);
%}

### Listar produtos do tenant
GET {{base_url}}/api/products
Authorization: Bearer {{tenant_token}}

### Editar produto
PUT {{base_url}}/api/products/{{product_id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{tenant_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "palavras_chave": ["trabalhista", "CLT", "rescisão", "FGTS", "hora extra"]
}

### Associar produto a lead manualmente
PUT {{base_url}}/api/leads/{{lead_id}}/product
Authorization: Bearer {{tenant_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "product_id": "{{product_id}}"
}

### Filtrar leads por produto
GET {{base_url}}/api/funnels/{{funnel_id}}/leads?product_id={{product_id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{tenant_token}}

### Excluir produto
DELETE {{base_url}}/api/products/{{product_id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{tenant_token}}
